=== Event 2: Voices ===

* Voice of Compassion: You’ve chosen this path for a reason. Keep moving forward, Argon. Don’t lose sight of what’s right.
* Voice of Doubt: Every step you take, you leave something behind. Your ideals won’t save you—or anyone else.
* Unknown Voice: You think this road is yours to walk? Your choices aren’t as free as you believe, Argon

=== Event 3: Voices ===
* Voice of Memory: Argon? By the processors, it’s really you! It’s been a long time. Tell me… do you still believe in what we once talked about? (Y/N)
*if Y: I knew it. You always saw the bigger picture, Argon. Stay on that path… the world needs people like you.
*if N: Oh, Argon. I guess even you couldn’t hold on forever. But don’t let this destroy who you are.

=== Event 4: Voices ===
* Voice of Challenge: Well, look who it is. Argon, still fighting the good fight, I assume? Tell me, have you grown tired of clinging to your ideals yet? (Y/N)
*if Y: Hmph. Idealism is a fool’s comfort, Argon. But maybe you’ll prove me wrong. Doubt it, though.
*if N: Ha! Finally, some clarity. Just remember, Argon, the world doesn’t wait for dreamers.

